OL,3,GNEWSALondon Ambulance Service sees 999
OL,4,Acalls surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon Ambulance Service (LAS) has
OL,7,Fdeclared a critical incident after days
OL,8,Fof sustained high demand.
OL,10,FThe service said that the previous
OL,11,Fthree days had seen approximately 500
OL,12,Fmore 999 calls than in the previous
OL,13,Fweek, with more than 7,300 calls a day
OL,14,Fover three consecutive days since
OL,15,FMonday.
OL,17,FLife-threatening emergencies involving
OL,18,Frespiratory problems are up by almost
OL,19,F20% and life or death emergencies, such
OL,20,Fas cardiac arrest, were up 10% when
OL,21,Fcompared to the same period last year.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
