OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALondon Ambulance Service sees 999
OL,4,Acalls surge
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The number of calls has remained very
OL,7,Fhigh for several days, so we have
OL,8,Fdeclared a critical incident to take
OL,9,Fextra steps to reach patients who need
OL,10,Fus most urgently," said Craig Harman,
OL,11,Fchief operating officer at LAS.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
